            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Samantha Gan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I cut the chocolate chips to 2 cups, and even then it seemed like a lot of chips. Although the cookies tasted fine and were generally liked by others, I have to say that they were not particularly impressive. They weren't different or interesting. They just tasted like slightly too sweet chocolate chip cookies. If you're looking for a twist on chocolate chip, this isn't it. Also, the recipe says 30 cookies, but I made chips ahoy size cookies and it came out to about 70.",
            "datePublished": "2007-09-16T08:24:40.670Z"
          },
